@startuml Login Sequence Diagram
actor User
participant ": LoginPage " as LoginPage
participant ": AuthForm " as AuthForm
participant ": AuthService " as AuthService
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": AuthController " as AuthController
participant ": AuthService " as BackendAuthService
participant ": UserRepository " as UserRepository
participant ": PasswordHelper " as PasswordHelper
participant ": JWT Service " as JWTService
database Database

User->LoginPage: 1. User navigate to Login
    activate User
activate LoginPage
LoginPage->LoginPage: 2. Render Login Form
LoginPage->AuthForm: 3. Render AuthForm Component
activate AuthForm
deactivate LoginPage
AuthForm->AuthForm: 4. User enters username and password
AuthForm->AuthService: 5. Call login(credentials)
deactivate AuthForm
activate AuthService
AuthService->Router: 6. Send POST /api/auth/login (credentials)
deactivate AuthService
activate Router
Router->AuthController: 7. Route Request to Controller
deactivate Router
activate AuthController
AuthController->BackendAuthService: 8. Call Login(loginRequest)
deactivate AuthController
activate BackendAuthService
BackendAuthService->BackendAuthService: 9. Validate credentials (check Vietnamese/spaces)
BackendAuthService->UserRepository: 10. Find User by Username/Email
activate UserRepository
UserRepository->Database: 11. Query User Record
activate Database
Database-->UserRepository: 12. User Record Found/Not Found
deactivate Database
UserRepository-->BackendAuthService: 13. Return User Data
deactivate UserRepository
BackendAuthService->PasswordHelper: 14. Verify Password
activate PasswordHelper
PasswordHelper->PasswordHelper: 15. Compare hashed password with provided password
PasswordHelper-->BackendAuthService: 16. Password Verification Result
deactivate PasswordHelper

alt credentials valid
    BackendAuthService->UserRepository: 17.1 Get User with Rights and Permissions
    activate UserRepository
    UserRepository->Database: 17.1.1 Query User with UserRights
    activate Database
    Database-->UserRepository: 17.1.2 Return User with Relations
    deactivate Database
    UserRepository-->BackendAuthService: 17.1.3 Return User with Permissions
    deactivate UserRepository
    
    BackendAuthService->JWT Service: 17.2 Generate JWT Token
    activate JWT Service
    JWT Service->JWT Service: 17.2.1 Create Claims (Id, Email, Role, Permissions)
    JWT Service->JWT Service: 17.2.2 Sign Token with Secret Key
    JWT Service->JWT Service: 17.2.3 Generate Refresh Token
    JWT Service-->BackendAuthService: 17.2.4 Return TokenModel (AccessToken, RefreshToken)
    deactivate JWT Service

    BackendAuthService-->AuthController: 17.3 Return TokenModel
        activate AuthController
    AuthController->AuthController: 17.4 Wrap in ResponseDto
    AuthController-->Router: 17.5 Send Success Response
    activate Router
    deactivate AuthController
    Router->Router: 17.6 Return Response with Token
    Router-->AuthService: 17.7 Return Token Data
    activate AuthService
    deactivate Router
    AuthService->AuthService: 17.8 Extract accessToken and refreshToken
    AuthService-->AuthForm: 17.9 Return Login Result
    activate AuthForm
    deactivate AuthService
    AuthForm->AuthForm: 17.10 Store Access Token in localStorage
    AuthForm->AuthForm: 17.11 Store Refresh Token in localStorage
    AuthForm->AuthService: 17.12 Call getMe() to get user info
    deactivate AuthForm
    activate AuthService
    AuthService->Router: 17.13 Send GET /api/auth/GetMe with Bearer Token
    deactivate AuthService
    activate Router
    Router->AuthController: 17.14 Route Request to GetMe
    activate AuthController
    deactivate Router
    AuthController->BackendAuthService: 17.15 Get Current User Info
    activate BackendAuthService
    BackendAuthService->UserRepository: 17.16 Get User by Id from Token
    activate UserRepository
    UserRepository->Database: 17.17 Query User Record
    activate Database
    Database-->UserRepository: 17.18 Return User Data
    deactivate Database
    UserRepository-->BackendAuthService: 17.19 Return User Entity
    deactivate UserRepository
    BackendAuthService-->AuthController: 17.20 Return UserDto
    deactivate BackendAuthService
    AuthController-->Router: 17.21 Send User Data
    activate Router
    deactivate AuthController
    Router-->AuthService: 17.22 Return User Info
    activate AuthService
    deactivate Router
    AuthService-->AuthForm: 17.23 Return User Data
    activate AuthForm
    deactivate AuthService
    AuthForm->AuthForm: 17.24 Dispatch setUser to Redux Store
    AuthForm->AuthForm: 17.25 Get User Star Points
    AuthForm->AuthForm: 17.26 Check User Role
    AuthForm->AuthForm: 17.27 Navigate based on Role (Admin -> UserManagement, Others -> Home)
    AuthForm-->User: 17.28 Redirect to Dashboard/Home
    deactivate AuthForm
    deactivate User
else credentials invalid
    BackendAuthService-->AuthController: 18.1 Send Error Response (InvalidCredentials)
    activate AuthController
    deactivate BackendAuthService
    AuthController->AuthController: 18.2 Wrap Error in ResponseDto
    AuthController-->Router: 18.3 Send Error Response (400 Bad Request)
    activate Router
    deactivate AuthController
    Router-->AuthService: 18.4 Return Error Response
    activate AuthService
    deactivate Router
    AuthService-->AuthForm: 18.5 Return Error Data
    activate AuthForm
    deactivate AuthService
    AuthForm->AuthForm: 18.6 Set Login Error State
    AuthForm-->User: 18.7 Display Error Message
    deactivate AuthForm
    deactivate User
end
@enduml


